    "“%@”不是可加入的普通文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is not a regular file that can be added."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”不符合 Windows 文件名规则，请重命名后再试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is not valid on Windows. Rename it and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”与“%@”在 Windows 中会发生名称冲突。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” and “%2$@” conflict on Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”与“%@”在压缩包中会发生名称冲突。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” and “%@” would collide inside the archive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”使用了当前版本无法编辑的加密或压缩方式，保存已取消。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” uses encryption or compression that this version cannot edit. Save canceled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”包含无效的文件路径，无法加入压缩包。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has an invalid file path and cannot be added to the archive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”已存在。继续创建将替换原有文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” already exists. Continuing will replace the existing file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”是特殊文件类型，无法归档。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is a special file type and cannot be archived."
          }
        }
      }
    },
