    "• ZIP / ZIPX（读写，内置 minizip-ng 引擎，支持 AES-256 加密）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• ZIP / ZIPX (read/write, built-in minizip-ng engine, AES-256 encryption)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 所有解压操作均经过路径安全检查，防止路径穿越攻击。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• All extractions pass path safety checks to prevent path traversal attacks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 诊断信息导出已脱敏，不包含用户路径或敏感数据。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Diagnostics export is sanitized and contains no user paths or sensitive data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 预览文件有大小限制，防止内存溢出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Previews are size-limited to prevent memory exhaustion."
